Amen!

And here's my second bit of advice, which I forgot about when I posted
that last message:

Never, ever, stand and fight multiple opponents in a room, always
retreat back to a doorway and take them on one at a time. Even if
you're confident that you're tough enough to kick their asses. OK,
maybe you will - but you'll take more damage than you need to, and
who knows what lies around the next corner?

